# Keep the Docker build context small and game-free. The Dockerfile COPYs only what the server needs
# (Core + Transport + Server + the build props + tests/data's default world); everything below is either
# build output, VCS metadata, or game-facing files a server image must never contain.
**/bin/
**/obj/
.git/
.github/
.vs/
dist/
Mods/
scratch/
*.user
# Machine-specific Derail Valley assembly resolution — game-free builds never need it (also gitignored).
Directory.Build.targets
# Game-facing projects (the mod + the Shim) — not part of a headless server image (hard rule 3).
src/LocoMP/
src/LocoMP.Shim/
